---
/** Matte ginstergelb whiteboard magnet, centred on the photo's top edge. */
---

<span class="magnet" aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
  .magnet {
    position: absolute;
    top: -9px;
    left: calc(50% - 11px);
    z-index: 4;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 36% 30%, #f3c032 0%, #e2a300 52%, #cd9300 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(120, 80, 0, 0.35),
      0 2px 2px rgba(32, 32, 29, 0.22),
      0 6px 10px -4px rgba(32, 32, 29, 0.3);
  }
</style>
